{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"唯識二十論校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"一．是書校歷二週．一譯校．二刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"二．譯校對勘．凡用五種異本。（一）梵文二十成唯識論．校註略稱梵本。（二）西藏勝","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"友等譯二十論釋．略稱藏本。（三）元魏菩提流支譯唯識論．略稱魏本。（四）陳真","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"諦譯大乘唯識論．略稱陳本。（五）唐義淨譯成唯識寶生論牒文．略稱寶本。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"三．譯校凡有三例。（一）諸本文句歧異者．皆註出曰．某本雲雲。（二）諸本譯義較暢","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"者．皆註出曰．勘某本雲雲。（三）因對勘而見奘譯改文或訛略者．皆註出曰．勘某","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"本雲雲．今譯雲雲。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"四．刻校以南宋刻爲底本．對勘麗刻．訂正文字．附註曰．原刻雲雲．依麗刻雲雲。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"五．今刊款式．頌文加註數字記其次第．又頌釋中外人徵難用⊙絕句以醒眉目。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"六．校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"（一）梵本二十成唯識論.Vims/tika^vijn~aptima^trata^siddhi(Vijn~aptima^trata^si-","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"ddhipp3-11).法人萊維氏SylvainLe/vi校刊本．一九二五年．巴黎版。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"（二）藏本二十論釋．n~i-c#u-pah!ih!grel-pa.曲尼版．丹珠經解部．ci字函四頁上","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"至一○頁上。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"（三）魏本唯識論．陳本大乘唯識論．寶本成唯識寶生論．皆用金陵刻經處刊","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"（四）本書南宋刻麗刻本．依據日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏經本","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_187_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_187","text":"校註。","sortOrder":20}],"overrides":{}}